czonego nie wpłynął żaden wniosek o dopuszczenie do udziału w postępowaniu albo wszystkie wnioski o dopuszczenie do udziału w postępowaniu zostały odrzucone na podstawie art. 146 ust. 1 pkt 2 albo nie zostały złożone żadne oferty albo wszystkie oferty zostały odrzucone na podstawie art. 226 ust. 1 pkt 2 lub, ze względu na ich niezgodność z opisem przedmiotu zamówienia, na podstawie art. 226 ust. 1 pkt 5, a pierwotne warunki zamówienia nie zostały w istotny sposób zmienione."},{"code":"unsuitable","field_id":"BT-136-Procedure","list":"direct-award-justification","ordinal":0,"type":"code"}]},{"kind":"LotAdditionalClassification","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotAdditionalClassification#0","values":[{"code":"85120000","field_id":"BT-263-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"}]},{"kind":"LotAdditionalClassification","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotAdditionalClassification#1","values":[{"code":"85121200","field_id":"BT-263-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"}]},{"kind":"LotAdditionalClassification","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotAdditionalClassification#2","values":[{"code":"85141000","field_id":"BT-263-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"}]},{"kind":"LotAdditionalClassification","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotAdditionalClassification#3","values":[{"code":"85145000","field_id":"BT-263-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"}]},{"kind":"LotAdditionalClassification","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotAdditionalClassification#4","values":[{"code":"85148000","field_id":"BT-263-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"}]},{"kind":"LotAwardCriterion","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotAwardCriterion#0","values":[{"code":"price","field_id":"BT-539-Lot","list":"award-criterion-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-540-Lot","lang":"POL","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Waga 8